{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08452","headline":"鲁郡尧祠送吴五之琅琊 · 李白","name":"鲁郡尧祠送吴五之琅琊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尧没三千岁，青松古庙存。\n送行奠桂酒，拜舞清心魂。\n日色促归人，连歌倒芳樽。\n马嘶俱醉起，分手更何言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《李太白集分类补注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/李太白集分類補註_(四庫全書本)）"}